  "files": [
    {
      "path": "index.html",
      "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>Pixel Temperature Converter</title>\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"style.css\">\n</head>\n<body>\n  <main class=\"card\">\n    <h1>Pixel Temp Converter</h1>\n    <p class=\"formula\">C to F: x * 9/5 + 32 &nbsp;|&nbsp; F to C: (x - 32) * 5/9</p>\n    <label for=\"temperature\">Temperature</label>\n    <input id=\"temperature\" type=\"text\" inputmode=\"decimal\" placeholder=\"e.g. 100\" autocomplete=\"off\">\n    <label for=\"direction\">Direction</label>\n    <select id=\"direction\">\n      <option value=\"c-to-f\">Celsius to Fahrenheit</option>\n      <option value=\"f-to-c\">Fahrenheit to Celsius</option>\n    </select>\n    <button id=\"convert\" type=\"button\">Convert</button>\n    <div class=\"result-box\">\n      <span class=\"result-label\">Result</span>\n      <output id=\"result\" aria-live=\"polite\">--</output>\n    </div>\n  </main>\n  <script src=\"script.js\"></script>\n</body>\n</html>",
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "path": "style.css",
      "content": ":root {\n  --bg: #1a1a2e;\n  --card: #16213e;\n  --accent: #e94560;\n  --text: #f0f0f0;\n  --muted: #a0a0b0;\n  --pixel: 4px;\n}\n* { box-sizing: border-box; }\nbody {\n  margin: 0;\n  min-height: 100vh;\n  display: grid;\n  place-items: center;\n  background: var(--bg);\n  background-image: linear-gradient(45deg, #0f0f1a 25%, transparent 25%),\n    linear-gradient(-45deg, #0f0f1a 25%, transparent 25%),\n    linear-gradient(45deg, transparent 75%, #0f0f1a 75%),\n    linear-gradient(-45deg, transparent 75%, #0f0f1a 75%);\n  background-size: 16px 16px;\n  font-family: system-ui, 'Segoe UI', monospace;\n  font-size: 18px;\n  color: var(--text);\n  padding: 16px;\n}\n.card {\n  background: var(--card);\n  border: var(--pixel) solid var(--accent);\n  box-shadow: 8px 8px 0 #000;\n  padding: 32px 24px;\n  width: 100%;\n  max-width: 420px;\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  gap: 12px;\n}\nh1 {\n  font-size: 1.6rem;\n  margin: 0 0 4px;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  letter-spacing: 2px;\n  color: var(--accent);\n  text-shadow: 2px 2px 0 #000;\n}\n.formula {\n  font-size: 0.85rem;\n  color: var(--muted);\n  margin: 0 0 8px;\n  line-height: 1.5;\n}\nlabel {\n  font-size: 1rem;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  letter-spacing: 1px;\n}\ninput, select, button {\n  font-family: inherit;\n  font-size: 1rem;\n  padding: 12px;\n  border: var(--pixel) solid var(--text);\n  background: #0f0f1a;\n  color: var(--text);\n  border-radius: 0;\n  width: 100%;\n}\ninput:focus, select:focus, button:focus {\n  outline: var(--pixel) solid var(--accent);\n  outline-offset: 2px;\n}\nbutton {\n  background: var(--accent);\n  color: #fff;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  letter-spacing: 2px;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  box-shadow: 4px 4px 0 #000;\n  transition: transform 0.05s, box-shadow 0.05s;\n}\nbutton:hover { background: #ff5c77; }\nbutton:active {\n  transform: translate(4px, 4px);\n  box-shadow: 0 0 0 #000;\n}\n.result-box {\n  margin-top: 8px;\n  padding: 16px;\n  border: var(--pixel) dashed var(--muted);\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  gap: 4px;\n}\n.result-label {\n  font-size: 0.85rem;\n  color: var(--muted);\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  letter-spacing: 1px;\n}\n#result {\n  font-size: 2rem;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  color: var(--accent);\n  word-break: break-all;\n}\n@media (max-width: 400px) {\n  .card { padding: 24px 16px; }\n  h1 { font-size: 1.3rem; }\n}",
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "path": "script.js",
      "content": "const tempInput = document.getElementById('temperature');\nconst directionSelect = document.getElementById('direction');\nconst convertBtn = document.getElementById('convert');\nconst resultEl = document.getElementById('result');\n\nfunction convert() {\n  const raw = tempInput.value.trim();\n  const value = Number(raw);\n\n  if (raw === '' || !Number.isFinite(value)) {\n    resultEl.textContent = 'Error';\n    return;\n  }\n\n  let converted;\n  if (directionSelect.value === 'c-to-f') {\n    converted = value * 9 / 5 + 32;\n  } else {\n    converted = (value - 32) * 5 / 9;\n  }\n\n  resultEl.textContent = converted.toFixed(2);\n}\n\nconvertBtn.addEventListener('click', convert);\n\ntempInput.addEventListener('keydown', (e) => {\n  if (e.key === 'Enter') convert();\n});",
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "path": "README.md",
      "content": "# Pixel Temperature Converter\n\nA tiny offline pixel-styled temperature converter built with plain HTML, CSS and JavaScript. No packages, no network requests, no storage.\n\n## Usage\n\nOpen `index.html` in any modern browser.\n\n1. Enter a temperature in the **Temperature** field.\n2. Choose a direction: **Celsius to Fahrenheit** (`c-to-f`) or **Fahrenheit to Celsius** (`f-to-c`).\n3. Click **Convert** (or press Enter in the input).\n4. The result appears with exactly two decimals and no units.\n\n## Formulas\n\n- Celsius to Fahrenheit: `x * 9/5 + 32`\n- Fahrenheit to Celsius: `(x - 32) * 5/9`\n\n## Error handling\n\n- Empty input, non-numeric text, `NaN`, `Infinity` or `-Infinity` produce the exact output `Error`.\n- The result field starts as `--`.\n\n## Files\n\n- `index.html` — structure and labeled controls (`temperature`, `direction`, `convert`, `result`).\n- `style.css` — pixel theme, responsive card layout, hover/focus/pressed states.\n- `script.js` — conversion logic using `addEventListener`.\n\n## Accessibility\n\n- All controls have associated labels.\n- Keyboard accessible: Tab to navigate, Enter to convert.\n- Visible focus outlines on inputs, select and button.\n- Live region (`aria-live=\"polite\"`) announces result changes.\n- Layout works from 360px wide; font sizes 16px or larger.\n\n## Constraints\n\n- Under 200 lines total.\n- No external assets, iframes, server code or inline event handlers.\n- Cohesive 5-color palette with CSS-only pixel graphics.",
      "description": ""
    }
  ]
